Raju maintains his composed approach, focusing on preparation rather than verbal sparring.

The tension in the complex has reached a palpable intensity.

Everyone seems aware that the match will bring the culmination of days of building conflict.

Raju moves through the environment with calm focus, while around him swirls excited chatter.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Angry">>
