<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Angry">>
Aryan: Because that's what's coming next.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Angry">>
Aryan: A war between your kind and mine.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Angry">>
Raju: Bring your war.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Angry">>
