<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Angry">>
Aryan: Those expensive toys are going to destroy your pathetic dreams!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Angry">>
Raju: My dreams are stronger than your toys.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Angry">>
Raju: You'll see.

<<HideCharacter>>

As Raju leaves the complex, anger courses through his veins.

Tomorrow's battle looms like a storm on the horizon.

